    "chunk_text": ", \u00fe\u00e6r nan mon \u00e6r ne si\u00fe\u00fean mid firde gefaran ne dorste, buton Alexandre. & he Seleucus geniedde ealle \u00fea ladteowas to his hiersumnesse, & hie alle Antigones & On \u00fe\u00e6m gefeohte w\u00e6s Antigones ofslagen & his sunu of \u00fe\u00e6m rice adr\u00e6fed. Ne wene ic, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Orosius, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig w\u00e6re \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t atellan mehte \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00f0\u00e6m gefeohte gefeoll. On \u00fe\u00e6re tide gefor Cassander & his sunu feng to \u00fe\u00e6m rice Philippus. \u00dea wende man eft o\u00feere si\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t gewinn Alexandres folgera geendad w\u00e6re. Ac hie sona \u00fe\u00e6s him betweonum wunnon; & Seleucus & Demetrias, Antigones sunu, him & hie \u00fe\u00e6t gewinn \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6s licost angunnan \u00fee hi hit \u00e6r ne angunnen. On \u00fe\u00e6m gewinne ofslog Antipater his modor, Cassandres lafe, \u00feeh \u00fee heo earmlice hiere feores to \u00dea b\u00e6d Alexander, hiere sunu, Demetrias \u00fe\u00e6t he him gefylste \u00fe\u00e6t he his modor slege on his bre\u00f0er \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m gewunnon Demetrias & Lisimachus; ac Lisimachus ne mehte Demetriase wi\u00f0stondan, \u00dea w\u00e6s Demetrias on \u00fe\u00e6re hwile swi\u00fee geanmet, & fird gel\u00e6dde to Ptholomeuse. \u00dea he \u00fe\u00e6t geascade \u00fea begeat he Seleucus him to fultume, & Pirrus Epira cyning. & Pirrus him for \u00feam swi\u00feost fylste, \u00fee he him selfum facade M\u00e6cedonia anweald; & hie \u00fea \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Lisimachus ofslog his",
